  "description": "The Olympic Village is full of athletes chasing glory, but Korean volleyball star Han Tae-Oh finds himself chasing something else entirely. After a charged encounter with Liam, a charismatic rugby player from the British national team, Tae-Oh cannot hide his attraction. His bold flirting quickly pulls them together, and the tension between them leads to a night neither of them expected. Tae-Oh believes it will remain a secret Olympic fling. Unfortunately, their story does not end there.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of Kingdom Company's Sarangi Kkotpineun Seonsuchon (사랑이 꽃피는 선수촌) Collection.*",
